---
description: Visual system & motion
globs: ["app/**", "components/**", "styles/**"]
---
- Light, bright, silver + green palette via CSS vars only. No random hex values in components.
- Prefer whitespace over borders. Tables borderless, green header text.
- Motion: GSAP ScrollTrigger + Lenis for scroll, Motion for UI. Durations 300-900ms, ease cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1).
- Every animated component must handle prefers-reduced-motion and pointer:coarse.
- Heavy visuals (WebGL) dynamic import, ssr:false, idle-loaded, static fallback.
- Mono micro-labels for technical feel. Max 2 font families.
